<del></del></span> Tier &amp; Set Bonuses for Arcane Mages in Mists of Pandaria Classic</span></h2>The set bonuses of Tier 15 provide a consistent and okay benefit for Arcane Mage, not only in the form of additional stats after Alter Time, but also by increasing the effect of Arcane Charges by 5% which helps its damage throughout. Although not very flashy bonuses, they're imposible to mess up and underutilize since they requires no gameplay changes nor thinking.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="tier-15">
