<del></del></span> Reputation for Arcane Mages in Phase 3</span></h2>As Arcane in Phase 3, only the Shado-Pan Assault items are relevant, assuming you're gearing up from already having most of the Phase 2 best in slot gear. And since you can get friendly relatively easily via the Isle of Thunder before raid, those items are great options to use as temporary upgrades.<br/>
